body:
The documentation page @BryanSchuetz links to, does not clearly explain how to implement this with the `instantsearch.js` library. Nor does the `SearchParameter` section on the algoliasearch-helper-js [reference page](https://community.algolia.com/algoliasearch-helper-js/reference.html#searchparameters).

I've got it working with the following code:
```javascript
const search = instantsearch({
  appId: '',
  apiKey: '',
  indexName: '',
  searchParameters: {
    facetingAfterDistinct: true,
  },
});
```
